  "notes": "## 0.3.1 - 2026-03-17\n\n### Features\n\n- Redesign the Devices page with an Apple-style card layout, improved status visibility, and refreshed spacing.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Make device online status follow stable mDNS LAN presence instead of transient business-stream readiness to prevent idle offline flicker.\n\n### Docs\n\n- Update setup instructions to document the Create/Join Encrypted Space flow with discovery and passphrase verification.\n- Refresh README feature documentation and screenshots to match current capabilities and architecture.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.3.1 - 2026-03-17\n\n### Features\n\n- 重构设备页面为 Apple 风格卡片布局，提升状态可见性并优化整体间距。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 将设备在线状态改为基于稳定的 mDNS 局域网可发现性，而非短暂的业务流就绪状态，修复空闲时离线闪烁问题。\n\n### Docs\n\n- 更新安装说明，补充创建/加入加密空间流程、设备发现与口令校验步骤。\n- 更新 README 的功能说明与截图，使其与当前能力和架构保持一致。",
